        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This letter is to confirm the agreement to return to monitoring absences under the former Absence Improvement Plan (AIP). The name of the program was changed during negotiations to the Absence Monitoring Program (AMP). The following write-up reflects the highlights of the program, including the two improvements to the plan to add an additional Step and to change an occurrence from 4 hours to 8 hours.",
            "block_bbox": [
                53,
