        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The AMP monitors non-FML absences that are taken for Sick-Self, Sick Family (unpaid), Elimination Sick (unpaid) and Elimination Vacation, Employee's absences are monitored on a rolling twelve (12) month period. Employees who have non-FML absences that exceed 41 hours will receive a counseling letter that places them in the program. Once an employee is placed in the program, they will be monitored on a calendar year from the last date of disability as follows (Leave Days will be counted once in the program).",
            "block_bbox": [
                53,
                343,
